  Content: Following the Awakening of the Evil Eye, all of the entrances to the dome
    surrounding Agartha were sealed off by AEIOU to prevent the Demons and the Evil
    Eye's presence from escaping Agartha into the rest of the world. This lockdown
    included the sealing of the Ruins (the home of the Demons), which was made possible
    by the invention of the Typocrypha.
